'''Stonecutters''' are [[Player base|base]] structures used for crafting [[Sharpening Stone]]s and building [[Stone Structures]], [[Black Marble Structures]], [[Grausten Structures]] and other stone based building elements. They are also needed to repair stone structures.

Crafting requires a roof and 70% [[cover]]. Building structures does not require a roof or any cover.

